<title>USA: Motorola seeks dismissal of Qualcomm suit.</title>
<headline>Motorola seeks dismissal of Qualcomm suit.</headline>
<dateline>LIBERTYVILLE, Ill. 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Motorola Inc said it had filed a motion in federal court in California seeking dismissal of a suit filed by Qualcomm Inc.</p>
<p>The dispute between the companies centers on Qualcomm's new &quot;Q&quot; phone. Motorola has sued Qualcomm in federal court in Illinois, alleging that the &quot;Q&quot; phone copies key design elements of Motorola's StarTAC cellular phone.</p>
<p>Qualcomm's suit asks the court to declare that the &quot;Q&quot; phone does not infringe Motorola's patents.</p>
<p>Motorola, in a statement released Thursday, said a hearing in the Illinois court is scheduled for next week.</p>
